Sometimes robots can do more if they work in teams. Just to practice
make a team of robots. The robot you just trained to count down can be
one member of the team. The other member is a mystery robot who
is already trained to produce a secret word when the box has zero
in it. 

We need the
secret word.

This is the result of saving everything in a room.
