Did you drop the robot you trained on top of the mystery robot?

Did you give the box to the team?

Did you wait until the mystery robot got a chance to work?

Well, what I would do is pick up the robot that counts down and drop
him on the mystery robot. This way the mystery robot will be first in line
to see if the box matches his thoughts. Then I'd give the box to the team and
wait for the mystery word to appear.


